{"3526420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rebels of the Realm", "steam_appid": 3526420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and dive into <i>Rebels of the Realm</i>, a vibrant low-poly co-op RPG built on chaotic spells, glorious screwups, and a healthy dose of goofy charm. The kingdom calls it a proving ground, a place to earn glory and the king's favor. But the deeper you descend, the harder that story gets to believe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Classes, One Party:</strong> Choose from Fighters, Mages, Rogues, and Paladins, each with their own abilities, playstyles, and role in the group. Tank the hits, sling spells from range, sneak in for the kill, or hold the line and keep your team alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap Classes Anytime:</strong> Tired of your Rogue? Curious what Paladin life feels like? Unlike most games in the genre, you can swap and upgrade any class whenever you're back in town, so no run ever locks you into a build you regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll Deaths, Reinvented:</strong> Our signature ragdoll physics turn player deaths into their own kind of chaos. Fallen teammates can end up flung halfway across the arena, so keep an eye on where they land. Revives are possible, but only if someone remembers to look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Worth Exploring:</strong> Wander through a richly detailed, low-poly fantasy world that channels the charm of classic RPGs while carving out its own identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up, Level Up:</strong> Collect powerful equipment, grow stronger with every dungeon cleared, and face tougher challenges that demand real teamwork, not just bigger numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serious Fun, Not Serious Tone:</strong> <i>Rebels of the Realm</i> doesn't take itself too seriously, but it takes your fun very seriously. Expect plenty of laughs alongside the genuine thrill of a hard-won victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the rebellion in <i>Rebels of the Realm</i>, where saving the world is a team effort, and every fight is a chance to be heroic in the most unexpectedly hilarious ways.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and dive into <i>Rebels of the Realm</i>, a vibrant low-poly co-op RPG built on chaotic spells, glorious screwups, and a healthy dose of goofy charm. The kingdom calls it a proving ground, a place to earn glory and the king's favor. But the deeper you descend, the harder that story gets to believe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Classes, One Party:</strong> Choose from Fighters, Mages, Rogues, and Paladins, each with their own abilities, playstyles, and role in the group. Tank the hits, sling spells from range, sneak in for the kill, or hold the line and keep your team alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap Classes Anytime:</strong> Tired of your Rogue? Curious what Paladin life feels like? Unlike most games in the genre, you can swap and upgrade any class whenever you're back in town, so no run ever locks you into a build you regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ragdoll Deaths, Reinvented:</strong> Our signature ragdoll physics turn player deaths into their own kind of chaos. Fallen teammates can end up flung halfway across the arena, so keep an eye on where they land. Revives are possible, but only if someone remembers to look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Worth Exploring:</strong> Wander through a richly detailed, low-poly fantasy world that channels the charm of classic RPGs while carving out its own identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up, Level Up:</strong> Collect powerful equipment, grow stronger with every dungeon cleared, and face tougher challenges that demand real teamwork, not just bigger numbers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serious Fun, Not Serious Tone:</strong> <i>Rebels of the Realm</i> doesn't take itself too seriously, but it takes your fun very seriously. Expect plenty of laughs alongside the genuine thrill of a hard-won victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the rebellion in <i>Rebels of the Realm</i>, where saving the world is a team effort, and every fight is a chance to be heroic in the most unexpectedly hilarious ways.</p>", "short_description": "Grab your friends, pick your class, and raid dungeons in this lighthearted co-op fantasy RPG, where chaotic spells and hilariously bad ragdoll deaths keep the realm unpredictable.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526420/ef5947e194d65556776eeac631fa5a225af48576/header.jpg?t=1785613582", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526420/f88ceb1599a03537f1fd66755391af8a9a187bb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785613582", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526420/f88ceb1599a03537f1fd66755391af8a9a187bb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785613582", "website": "https://www.greengamingstudios.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GT 1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stro